{"id":"a347964aa38cf06e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Ideal Additivity","display":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity — ZFC Ideal Ideal Additivity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity — ZFC Ideal Ideal Additivity","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-ideal-additivity — ZFC Ideal Ideal Additivity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealAdditivity}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealAdditivity}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}additivity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealAdditivity}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land|\\mathcal A|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal B\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal B|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}additivity} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealIdealAdditivity}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land|\\mathcal A|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal I\\;\\bigl(\\bigcup\\mathcal B\\notin\\mathcal I\\to\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal B|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The minimum is expressed by a witnessing family and a lower-bound clause, so the predicate is false when no union escapes the ideal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"